sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant Frontend
  participant API as FastAPI
  participant Service as DiagnosisService
  participant Adapter as AgentAdapter
  participant Orch as OrchestratorAgent
  participant Parser as SymptomParser
  participant Dx as DiagnosisAgent
  participant Lit as LiteratureAgent
  participant Cases as CaseStudyAgent
  participant Explain as ExplainabilityAgent
  User->>Frontend: Submit natural-language symptoms
  Frontend->>API: POST /api/analyze
  API->>Service: Create processing DiagnosisCase
  Service->>Adapter: analyze(text)
  Adapter->>Orch: process_natural_language_input(text)
  Orch->>Parser: extract_symptoms_from_text
  Parser-->>Orch: symptoms or error
  Orch->>Orch: Apply safety-warning rules
  Orch->>Dx: diagnose(symptoms, default context)
  Dx-->>Orch: ranked diagnoses
  Orch->>Lit: process(diagnoses, symptoms)
  Lit-->>Orch: evidence or unavailable
  Orch->>Cases: process(diagnoses, symptoms)
  Cases-->>Orch: case reports or unavailable
  Orch->>Explain: generate_explainability_report
  Explain-->>Orch: report
  Orch-->>Adapter: raw result
  Adapter-->>Service: raw result
  Service->>Service: Normalize and persist result
  Service-->>API: completed result
  API-->>Frontend: case_id and status/result
  Note over Lit,Cases: Sequential conditional calls; not parallel
